The final receipt is final/review-validation.json, copied unchanged to review-validation.json for root convenience. The exact reviewed installer is final/source/root-installer.mjs.snapshot. It requires --install, an explicit review manifest SHA, exact source gates and an absent owned installation folder. Root must manually approve the receipt's acceptance flags before invoking it; the installer authenticates the review manifest but does not itself parse those flags. No claim of atomic/race-free filesystem authentication or full product parity follows.

